  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>For the following ion/compounds</p><p><img src=\"assets\\st0284_37e5c7019c83.png\" style=\"width: 243px; height: 228px;\" /></p><p>The main difference between aromatic antiaromatic and nonaromatic is that aromatic means having a delocalized pi electron system with (4n +2) electrons and antiaromatic means having a delocalized pi electron system with 4 electrons whereas nonaromatic means there is no delocalized electron system in that molecule.</p>"
